==Description==
The '''Lunar Crate''' is a limited-time crate, priced at {{Coins|5,000}}. This crate yields six [[wp:Lunar New Year|Lunar New Year]]-themed skins. Skins from this crate can also appear in the [[Daily Store#Daily Skin Store|Daily Skin Store]].

Each skin that can be gotten from the '''Lunar Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin. In the Daily Skin Store, all skins have a cost of {{Coins|5,000}}.

The '''Lunar Crate''' is a red chest with traditional Chinese styles, with snakes around the walls and red roof, as the year 2025 was the [[wp:Snake (zodiac)|year of the snake]] in Chinese Zodiac. It can be opened by removing a green key on a barrel. While the '''Lunar Crate''' celebrates the Lunar New Year, its design is more akin to elements from the [[wp:Chinese New Year|Chinese New Year]] festival.

